  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The combined equation of the two lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;can be written as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. The equation of the angle bisectors of the lines represented by the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is</p>"
